      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ありがとラリ。\r\n怖くて泣いちゃうところだったラリ。\r\n……ぐすんラリ。",
        "official_en": "Thank you. I was so scared that I was on the verge of tears, lali...\r\nBoohoo, lali...",
