      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、シドと働けたのは良い経験だったラリ。\r\nひと回りもふた回りも大きくなれた気がするラリ。\r\n……サイズの話じゃないラリ。",
        "official_en": "Workin’ with Cid was nice, though. I feel embiggened by the experience—I’m talkin’ about my skills, not my waistline, mind you.",
        "real_en": "But working with Cid was a good experience, lali. I feel like I've grown one or two sizes, lali. ...I'm not talking about my actual size, lali."
      },
      "review": {
